# 4-Bit Ripple Carry Adder Circuit Netlist

INPUT A0 A1 A2 A3 B0 B1 B2 B3 Cin
OUTPUT S0 S1 S2 S3 Cout
WIRE w1_0 w2_0 w3_0 C0
WIRE w1_1 w2_1 w3_1 C1
WIRE w1_2 w2_2 w3_2 C2
WIRE w1_3 w2_3 w3_3

# Stage 0: LSB Addition
GATE XOR g1_0 A0 B0 w1_0
GATE XOR g2_0 w1_0 Cin S0
GATE AND g3_0 A0 B0 w2_0
GATE AND g4_0 w1_0 Cin w3_0
GATE OR  g5_0 w2_0 w3_0 C0

# Stage 1: Bit 1 Addition
GATE XOR g1_1 A1 B1 w1_1
GATE XOR g2_1 w1_1 C0 S1
GATE AND g3_1 A1 B1 w2_1
GATE AND g4_1 w1_1 C0 w3_1
GATE OR  g5_1 w2_1 w3_1 C1

# Stage 2: Bit 2 Addition
GATE XOR g1_2 A2 B2 w1_2
GATE XOR g2_2 w1_2 C1 S2
GATE AND g3_2 A2 B2 w2_2
GATE AND g4_2 w1_2 C1 w3_2
GATE OR  g5_2 w2_2 w3_2 C2

# Stage 3: MSB Addition
GATE XOR g1_3 A3 B3 w1_3
GATE XOR g2_3 w1_3 C2 S3
GATE AND g3_3 A3 B3 w2_3
GATE AND g4_3 w1_3 C2 w3_3
GATE OR  g5_3 w2_3 w3_3 Cout
